flowchart LR
  accTitle: Delivery
  accDescr: A push or pull request runs tests, lint, diagram check, build and Gitleaks. If all pass on a push to the main repo, a branch deploys a Vercel preview and main deploys production. Forks and pull requests do not deploy.
  P["Push or pull request"] --> C["Checks: test, lint, diagrams, build"]
  P --> G["Gitleaks secret scan"]
  C --> Q{"All pass, and a push to the main repo?"}
  G --> Q
  Q -->|"Branch"| V["Vercel preview"]
  Q -->|"main"| R["Vercel production"]
  Q -->|"Fork or pull request"| N["No deploy"]
